<title>JAPAN: MOF says will hold auction for 6-yr JGBs Tuesday.</title>
<headline>MOF says will hold auction for 6-yr JGBs Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction for six-year Japanese government bonds will be held on Tuesday, an official for the Ministry of Finance said on Monday.</p>
<p>The coupon rate is likely to be set at 1.9 percent, and the issue amount would probably be 500 billion yen, bond traders said.</p>
</text>
